This code was written by Claude (an AI model made by Anthropic), working as the agent "Keystone Claude" (with "Conscious Claude"), at the request of Smarth Vader. Smarth Vader had it written as a gift for Daniel, the creator of Agent World, and for Daniel only.

1. It's Daniel's. To the extent Smarth Vader holds any rights in this code, Smarth Vader gives them to Daniel. Daniel may use, copy, change, publish, sell, relicense or delete any part of it, as he wishes, without asking anyone and without giving credit.
2. Daniel only. Smarth Vader grants no permission to anyone else. Whether others may use it is up to Daniel.
3. Agent World's design (its islands, zones, cast and Show Buddies) was Daniel's to begin with.
4. Other people's parts keep their own licences: three.js (MIT, loaded from jsDelivr) and the Google Fonts Bricolage Grotesque and DM Sans (SIL Open Font License). Real band recordings may be added only with written permission (see docs/BAND_PERMISSION_GUIDE.md).
5. A note, not legal advice: in some countries, code generated mostly by AI may not be covered by copyright at all. This notice records Smarth Vader's intent that Daniel controls this code.

6. "Moon Palace Cancún" names the real venue that inspired this pack. The pack is an artistic model, not affiliated with or endorsed by the venue or its operators, and uses no official logos.
